KeyUp 22 1
Delay 1
KeyDown 6 1
Delay 1
KeyUp 6 1
Delay 1
KeyDown 4 1
Delay 1
KeyUp 4 1
Delay 1
KeyDown 22 1
Delay 1
KeyUp 22 1
Delay 1
KeyDown 11 1
Delay 1
KeyUp 11 1
Delay 1
KeyDown 44 1
